[6/8] Patch-change model
======================================================================
Average miss in winrate points (lower is better) - each patch predicted from earlier ones
  last   = last patch's winrate pulled toward 50% (simple baseline)
  base   = strength model (recent + long-term winrate, popularity)
  best   = base + best-guess effect of the balance changes
  bold   = base + bold effect (sized like real patch swings)
  alpha  = how strongly the best guess is held back ('none' = switched off)
  route  = direct (balance numbers -> winrate), perf (balance numbers -> damage, gold,
           ... -> winrate) or avg (both), whichever did best on the latest patches

